                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>President Truman was asked at his press conference of September 9 whether
                    recognition of the Government of Israel would have to wait until after the
                    election in that country. He replied that “I have that matter under
                    consideration now. I cannot give you a definite answer on it now.” (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Public Papers of the Presidents of the United States:
                        Harry S. Truman, 1948</hi>, page 482.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
